<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on the</p>
<p>second day of four-day Supersport Series, formerly Castle Cup,</p>
<p>cricket matches on Saturday.</p>
<p>In Cape Town: Western Province 220 and 31-0, Northern</p>
<p>Transvaal 355 (R.Pienaar 95, R.Richardson 56).</p>
<p>In Durban: Natal 332 (D.Benkenstein 129, M.Bruyns 73,</p>
<p>S.Pollock 66, V.Drakes 8-59) and 22-0, Border 205.</p>
<p>In Paarl: Boland 268, Griqualand West 249-9 (P.Barnard 64).</p>
</text>
